    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Fast &amp; slow pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">In-place reversal</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/palindrome-linked-list/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 234</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Palindrome Linked List</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A singly linked list cannot walk backwards, so make half of it walk backwards: find the middle with fast/slow pointers, reverse the back half in place, compare the two halves node by node, then reverse it back. O(n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
